# Project Overview

This repo is a **base admin dashboard** frontend. The app lives at `dp-dashboard/dpdashboard/`.

## Stack

- React 18 + TypeScript + Vite
- React Router v6, TanStack Query v5, Axios
- React Hook Form + Zod, react-hot-toast
- Tailwind + Radix/shadcn-style components, AG Grid via `GenericDataGrid`
- i18next (en/ar, RTL)
- Laravel Sanctum Bearer auth + Laravel Reverb (Echo) for notifications

## Backend contract

External Laravel API. Env: `VITE_API_URL`, `VITE_REVERB_*`.

- Auth: `POST /login`, `GET /user`, `POST /logout` (under `VITE_API_URL` which ends with `/admin`)
- CRUD: REST relative paths (`/users`, …) → full URL `.../admin/users`
- Validation: `422 { message, errors: { field: [msgs] } }`
- Notifications: `GET /notifications` + private channel `App.Models.User.{id}`

## Features to keep

`auth`, `dashboard`, `users` (CRUD template), `settings` (generic), `reports`, `notifications`.

Do not reintroduce travel/blog/analytics/help modules or sibling backend/marketing projects.
